        "created_at": "2015-03-05T18:05:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm loath to join you in your rhyming way,<br>For fear of being thought a faded clone,<br>But yet I feel your rhymes are here to stay,<br>And such fun is seldom moreso alone.<br>I have my own experience in rhyme,<br>And thus may seek to join you for a time.</p>",
